# NativeWind spacing — `gap-*` on parent

- **Use:** `flex flex-col gap-{n}` or `flex flex-row gap-{n}` for spacing between siblings.
- **Limit:** `mt-*` / `mb-*` / `ml-*` / `mr-*` on children — prefer parent `gap-*` (one place to change rhythm when adding elements).
- **Never:** `space-*` (native no-op), `gap-x-*` / `gap-y-*` (unreliable on native — use `gap-*`).

See `component-rules/nativewind-gap-spacing-auto.mdc`.
